    {
        "Id": 67,
        "ActionId": 67,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            1,
            "Hassen",
            "Has anything similar happened to other Constructs before, Wells?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 68,
        "ActionId": 68,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Wells",
            "Sure, but only to Constructs carrying out special missions who couldn't retreat from a heavily infected area in time.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 69,
        "ActionId": 69,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Wells",
            "According to the location data of 【kuroname】, Gray Raven was near the edge of the Clean Zone, where the concentration level of Punishing Virus is extremely low, making this highly improbable.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 70,
        "ActionId": 70,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Wells",
            "The other possibility is a case like Noan, who has found a way to control it. The report of 【kuroname】 doesn't show any trace of Ascendants near Lucia.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 71,
        "ActionId": 71,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Wells",
            "Now, whether or not the Mind Beacon of 【kuroname】 is corrupted...",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 72,
        "ActionId": 72,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Remembering the people who are still under treatment, Hassen shakes his head."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 73,
        "ActionId": 73,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hassen",
            "【kuroname】 was one of the earliest people who left the hospital. Given the history of 【kuroname】, they did twice the checkups on this commandant.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 74,
        "ActionId": 74,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hassen",
            "And Lucia was the one who showed signs of infection first. It's highly unlikely that the Mind Beacon of 【kuroname】 was infected in the first place.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 75,
        "ActionId": 75,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Wells",
            "I agree.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 76,
        "ActionId": 76,
        "Type": 202,
        "Params": [
            2,
            "",
            "",
            "",
            "",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 77,
        "ActionId": 77,
        "Type": 201,
        "Params": [
            2,
            500012,
            "",
            400
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 78,
        "ActionId": 78,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            1,
            "Nikola",
            "None of us are surgeons of Constructs from Star of Life or experts of the M.I.N.D. from the Science Council. We won't find the truth just by talking among ourselves.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 79,
        "ActionId": 79,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hassen",
            "Still, we need a hypothesis based on facts before we decide how to proceed.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 80,
        "ActionId": 80,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Nikola",
            "I'll cut to the chase, then. Let's assume Lucia's M.I.N.D. was the source of the problem.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 81,
        "ActionId": 81,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hassen",
            "What makes you so certain? Your instinct?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 82,
        "ActionId": 82,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Nikola",
            "【kuroname】 might be an excellent commandant, but there's nothing special or strange about 【kuroname】.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 83,
        "ActionId": 83,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Nikola",
            "Meanwhile, Lucia... Hmph. Don't forget that her M.I.N.D. has always been an uncertainty.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 84,
        "ActionId": 84,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hassen",
            "The M.I.N.D. backup...",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 85,
        "ActionId": 85,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Nikola",
            "She might be our most successful attempt, but she is also our only successful attempt.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 86,
        "ActionId": 86,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Nikola",
            "Of course, it's possible that Ascendants or Hetero-Creatures suddenly obtain the ability to corrupt Constructs from an incredible distance.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 87,
        "ActionId": 87,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Nikola",
            "But if that's true, we won't have to bother with the reclamation of Earth.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 88,
        "ActionId": 88,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Nikola",
            "Donning the first specialized frame, being the only success of the M.I.N.D. backup procedure, diving into the Deep M.I.N.D. of an Ascendant...",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 89,
        "ActionId": 89,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Nikola",
            "Gray Raven is special, and Lucia most of all.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
