    {
        "Id": 96,
        "ActionId": 96,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            1,
            "Nikola",
            "I'm not. I suggest recalling Gray Raven and sending 【kuroname】 to the military for supervision and questioning.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 97,
        "ActionId": 97,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hassen",
            "You want to put 【kuroname】 in the military's care so that Kurono can't imprison the commandant in the name of \"observation\" again?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 98,
        "ActionId": 98,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hassen",
            "You must have eliminated many uncontrollable factors if you can make a guarantee like that.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 99,
        "ActionId": 99,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Nikola",
            "What I did is no different from what you've been doing lately. I just started earlier.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 100,
        "ActionId": 100,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Nikola",
            "They have seen through this facade of our opposition already, so there's no reason to keep it up. Kurono might have a powerful presence in the military, but I was sitting idly by and doing nothing.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 101,
        "ActionId": 101,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Nikola",
            "Their tentacles can no longer reach as far as they once did.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 102,
        "ActionId": 102,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Nikola says nonchalantly."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 103,
        "ActionId": 103,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hassen",
            "What are you planning to do to Lucia?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 104,
        "ActionId": 104,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Nikola",
            "I can make as many excuses as needed if the Science Council can fix what's happening to her.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 105,
        "ActionId": 105,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
